# agent-cradley

KALU — industry-grade personal AI agent (starter scaffold)

This repository now contains a polished personal AI assistant for a web user.

Features:
- modern chat interface
- browser-based conversation UI
- Node.js backend with local fallback intelligence
- optional OpenAI API integration via `OPENAI_API_KEY`
- responsive dark theme
- quick prompt chips and session reset

Run locally:

```bash
node server.js
```

Then open:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

Optional AI provider:

```bash
cp .env.example .env
# add your OpenAI key
```

The app will use OpenAI automatically when the key is present; otherwise it falls back to a built-in local assistant engine.

This is intentionally lightweight and dependency-free so it runs quickly in a clean environment.




























---

Built to be a strong starter for a personal AI product experience.
































































































































































































